{"pageid":1614,"title":"Emberbane","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Emberbane</span>","revid":20955,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote><p><i><big>\"An Adurite battleaxe, repurposed to ignite trees with the flames inside of them.\"</big></i></p></blockquote><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Emberbane</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/56/Emberbane.png/revision/latest?cb=20230822201020\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Emberbane\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/56/Emberbane.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230822201020\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/56/Emberbane.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230822201020 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/56/Emberbane.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20230822201020 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Emberbane\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\" data-image-key=\"Emberbane.png\" data-image-name=\"Emberbane.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Power\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Power</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0.7</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Distance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Distance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">15 Studs</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Time\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Time</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.75</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$51,800 (in materials and Large Bombs)</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.37.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">August 18th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Emberbane\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b2/Diamond_Main_Titles.png/revision/latest?cb=20250605041421\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Diamond Main Titles\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b2/Diamond_Main_Titles.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/75?cb=20250605041421\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Diamond Main Titles.png\" data-image-key=\"Diamond_Main_Titles.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> Emberbane</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Emberbane</b> is a double-bladed battle-axe forged from <a href=\"/wiki/Adurite\" title=\"Adurite\">Adurite</a>. It is obtained through completing a puzzle involving multiple separate side-quests. It is also part of the Expert Pack as a gamepass. \n</p><p>The Emberbane is obtained by fusing a <a href=\"/wiki/Meteor_core\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Meteor core\">Meteor Core</a>, an <a href=\"/wiki/Adurite_Key\" title=\"Adurite Key\">Adurite Key</a>, and a <a href=\"/wiki/Skull\" title=\"Skull\">Burning Skull</a> together in a cave behind a secret destructible wall. This axe has the unique ability to strike 2-3 times in a single swing on all types of wood with the notable exception of the following trees: <a href=\"/wiki/Hallow_Tree\" title=\"Hallow Tree\">Hallow Trees</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Tree\" title=\"Magma Tree\">Magma Trees</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Ash_Tree\" title=\"Ash Tree\">Ash Trees</a>. While each individual hit is roughly as powerful as those delivered by the <a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Axe\" title=\"Refined Axe\">Refined Axe</a>, these hits can stack together for a small boost in cutting speed.\n</p><p>The Emberbane also has a special bonus against Magma Trees and Ash Trees. Instead of striking multiple times, the Emberbane gains massively increased power, allowing it to cut Magma Trees in 3-5 swings (a Tall Refined Axe typically takes 16-17 swings) and Ash Trees in 1-2 swings (compared to 4-5 swings from a Tall Refined Axe.)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Emberbane_Quest\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/2a/Hexagon_Quests.png/revision/latest?cb=20250605040724\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Hexagon Quests\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/2a/Hexagon_Quests.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20250605040724\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Hexagon Quests.png\" data-image-key=\"Hexagon_Quests.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>Emberbane Quest</span></h2>\n<p><i>**While not necessary, it is advised to do this quest on a solo server to prevent item theft.</i>\n</p><p>Three special items are required to complete this quest. Before starting, note that to complete this quest, you must at least have the following:\n</p>\n<ul><li>$47,000 to buy a Refined Pickaxe, Refined Axe, and Refined Chisel.</li>\n<li>Around $24,000 to buy enough Bombs to explode walls at the <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Caves\" title=\"Magma Caves\">Magma Cave</a> entrance in <a href=\"/wiki/Mike%27s_Mines\" title=\"Mike&#39;s Mines\">Mike's Mines</a>, the wooden seal on <a href=\"/wiki/Skull_Rock\" title=\"Skull Rock\">Skull Rock</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater\" title=\"Ferwater\">Ferwater</a>, the entrance to the <a href=\"/wiki/Acidlands\" title=\"Acidlands\">Acidlands</a> (or, alternatively, the <a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Scooba_Tank\" title=\"Refined Scooba Tank\">Refined Scooba Tank</a> to drive to the Acidlands beach), and the unmarked entrance to the Emberbane ruins.</li></ul>\n<p>The following lists the first three steps required to accomplish the Emberbane quest. Complete them in any order.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Meteor_Core\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/bd/Diamond_Subtitle.png/revision/latest?cb=20250605041031\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Diamond Subtitle\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/bd/Diamond_Subtitle.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20250605041031\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Diamond Subtitle.png\" data-image-key=\"Diamond_Subtitle.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> Meteor Core</span></h3>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b0/Meteor_Crash.png/revision/latest?cb=20250617005036\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"A Meteor Core at the center of a Meteor impact.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"115\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Meteor Crash.png\" data-image-key=\"Meteor_Crash.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b0/Meteor_Crash.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250617005036\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b0/Meteor_Crash.png/revision/latest?cb=20250617005036\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"A Meteor Core at the center of a Meteor impact.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b0/Meteor_Crash.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250617005036\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"115\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Meteor Crash.png\" data-image-key=\"Meteor_Crash.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b0/Meteor_Crash.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250617005036\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Meteor_Crash.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">A Meteor Core at the center of a Meteor impact.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<ul><li>Obtain a <a href=\"/wiki/Meteor_core\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Meteor core\">Meteor Core</a>.\n<ul><li>Meteor Cores have been buffed to have a 100% chance to spawn in both Magmafied Meteors and Electrified Meteors.</li>\n<li>Meteors land about every hour or so. If you want to know when a meteor lands, ask the <a href=\"/wiki/Junior_Scientist\" title=\"Junior Scientist\">Jr. Scientist</a> for $3500.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h3><span id=\"Adurite_Key_Sidequest_.28Pedestal_Puzzle_v2.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Adurite_Key_Sidequest_(Pedestal_Puzzle_v2)\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/bd/Diamond_Subtitle.png/revision/latest?cb=20250605041031\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Diamond Subtitle\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Diamond Subtitle.png\" data-image-key=\"Diamond_Subtitle.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/bd/Diamond_Subtitle.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20250605041031\" /></a></span> Adurite Key Sidequest (Pedestal Puzzle v2)</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Obtain the <a href=\"/wiki/Adurite_Key\" title=\"Adurite Key\">Adurite Key</a>.\n<ul><li>Initiate the Pedestal Puzzle by pressing the secret <a href=\"/wiki/Mike%27s_Mines\" title=\"Mike&#39;s Mines\">Red&#160;? Button</a> in the ceiling of the underground lake in <a href=\"/wiki/Mike%27s_Mines\" title=\"Mike&#39;s Mines\">Mike's Mines</a>.\n<ul><li>You should hear a special sound effect that verifies the Pedestal Puzzle is activated. Three Pedestals across the entire map of Oaklands should now display a neon red ring around them.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Purchase a <a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Pickaxe\" title=\"Refined Pickaxe\">Refined Pickaxe</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Axe\" title=\"Refined Axe\">Refined Axe</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Chisel\" title=\"Refined Chisel\">Refined Chisel</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">Oak Depot</a> for $47,000.</li>\n<li>Travel to <a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_AutoLogistics\" title=\"Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics\">Alan's Auto-Logistics</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Finlay\" title=\"Finlay\">Finlay Taiga</a>. Find the pedestal on the rock in-front of the store. Place the <a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Axe\" title=\"Refined Axe\">Refined Axe</a> on this Pedestal.</li>\n<li>Travel to the <a href=\"/wiki/Lost_woods\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lost woods\">Lost Woods</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Finlay\" title=\"Finlay\">Finlay Farlands</a> (North Finlay). Find the pedestal in the center of the forest. Place the <a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Pickaxe\" title=\"Refined Pickaxe\">Refined Pickaxe</a> on this Pedestal.</li>\n<li>Travel to the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Oke desert (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvT2tlX2Rlc2VydD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Oke Desert</span> in <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater\" title=\"Ferwater\">Ferwater</a>. Find the pedestal inside the Canyon in the center of Oke Desert. Place the <a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Chisel\" title=\"Refined Chisel\">Refined Chisel</a> on this Pedestal.</li>\n<li>Once all three items have been placed in their respective pedestals, travel to the <a href=\"/wiki/Acidlands\" title=\"Acidlands\">Acidlands</a> via any route. Once inside, travel upwards and find the final Pedestal.</li>\n<li>Collect the <a href=\"/wiki/Adurite_Key\" title=\"Adurite Key\">Adurite Key</a> that has spawned on this Pedestal.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Burning_Skull_Sidequest\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/bd/Diamond_Subtitle.png/revision/latest?cb=20250605041031\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Diamond Subtitle\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Diamond Subtitle.png\" data-image-key=\"Diamond_Subtitle.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/bd/Diamond_Subtitle.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20250605041031\" /></a></span> Burning Skull Sidequest</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Obtain the <a href=\"/wiki/Skull\" title=\"Skull\">Burning Skull</a>.<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 200px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/20/Skull_Rock_Location.gif/revision/latest?cb=20250617012230\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Location of Skull Rock, starting from the entrance to Ferwater.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Skull Rock Location.gif\" data-image-key=\"Skull_Rock_Location.gif\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/20/Skull_Rock_Location.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20250617012230\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/20/Skull_Rock_Location.gif/revision/latest?cb=20250617012230\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Location of Skull Rock, starting from the entrance to Ferwater.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/20/Skull_Rock_Location.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20250617012230\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Skull Rock Location.gif\" data-image-key=\"Skull_Rock_Location.gif\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/20/Skull_Rock_Location.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20250617012230\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Skull_Rock_Location.gif\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Location of Skull Rock, starting from the entrance to Ferwater.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<ul><li>Bring at least six Small Bombs or equivalent from a shop that sells explosives, such as <a href=\"/wiki/Mike%27s_Mines\" title=\"Mike&#39;s Mines\">Mike's Mines</a> shop, <a href=\"/wiki/Dugg%27s_Digging\" title=\"Dugg&#39;s Digging\">Dugg's Digging</a>, or the <a href=\"/wiki/Pirate_Boat\" title=\"Pirate Boat\">Pirate Boat</a> shop. Place the bombs in your truck.</li>\n<li>Travel to Oke Desert in Ferwater. Find Skull Rock with the explosives in tow.\n<ul><li>Use explosives on the wooden seal on Skull Rock. Retrieve the <a href=\"/wiki/Skull\" title=\"Skull\">Skull</a> quest item. Place the Skull in your truck.</li>\n<li>Alternatively, travel to the <a href=\"/wiki/Acidlands\" title=\"Acidlands\">Acidlands</a> and purchase a weapon. Kill Skeletons in the Acidlands or the <a href=\"/wiki/Lost_woods\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lost woods\">Lost Woods</a> until you receive a <a href=\"/wiki/Skull\" title=\"Skull\">Skull</a> mob drop.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>\n<ul><li>Travel to the <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Caves\" title=\"Magma Caves\">Magma Caves</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Mike%27s_Mines\" title=\"Mike&#39;s Mines\">Mike's Mines</a> with the Skull.\n<ul><li>Use explosives to unlock the entrance to the Magma Caves.</li>\n<li>Place the Skull next to any Lava pool. Watch the skull to see if it darkens.</li>\n<li>After a few minutes next to the Lava pool, the name of the Skull should change to the <a href=\"/wiki/Skull\" title=\"Skull\">Burning Skull</a>.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<ul><li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li></ul>\n<ul><li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li></ul>\n<p>Once you have all three materials, proceed with the following:\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Fusion_into_the_Emberbane\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/bd/Diamond_Subtitle.png/revision/latest?cb=20250605041031\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Diamond Subtitle\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Diamond Subtitle.png\" data-image-key=\"Diamond_Subtitle.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/bd/Diamond_Subtitle.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20250605041031\" /></a></span> Fusion into the Emberbane</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Acquire Two <a href=\"/wiki/Small_Bomb\" title=\"Small Bomb\">Small Bombs</a>, which can be purchased from <a href=\"/wiki/Mike%27s_Mines\" title=\"Mike&#39;s Mines\">Mike's Mines</a> or any other explosives shop.</li>\n<li>Travel to the Finlay Farlands (North Finlay). Look for the back entrance to <a href=\"/wiki/Flowering_Meadows\" title=\"Flowering Meadows\">Flowering Meadows</a>. To the left of this entrance is an unmarked breakable wall. It is tinted a slightly different brown than the rest of the hillside.</li></ul>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-center show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 200px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a8/Emberbane_Wall_Location.gif/revision/latest?cb=20250617002627\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The location of the breakable wall for the Emberbane Quest, starting from the , \" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emberbane Wall Location.gif\" data-image-key=\"Emberbane_Wall_Location.gif\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a8/Emberbane_Wall_Location.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20250617002627\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a8/Emberbane_Wall_Location.gif/revision/latest?cb=20250617002627\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The location of the breakable wall for the Emberbane Quest, starting from the , \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a8/Emberbane_Wall_Location.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20250617002627\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Emberbane Wall Location.gif\" data-image-key=\"Emberbane_Wall_Location.gif\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a8/Emberbane_Wall_Location.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20250617002627\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Emberbane_Wall_Location.gif\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">The location of the breakable wall for the Emberbane Quest, starting from the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">Oak Depot</a>, </p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<ul><li>Use the two Small Bombs you brought to destroy the wall. The entrance will be a hole, make sure to take the crafting materials with you when you drop down, as the hole is very small. Make sure you have all three materials at once before trying to fuse them - they may despawn if placed outside of your base. This passageway is no longer a one-way drop and the Fusion/Gravity coil is no longer a necessity.</li>\n<li>Lay the items in their correct slot as indicated by the images above it:<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 233px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0e/The_3_items.png/revision/latest?cb=20231004160102\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The three items required.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"233\" height=\"133\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"The 3 items.png\" data-image-key=\"The_3_items.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0e/The_3_items.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/233?cb=20231004160102\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0e/The_3_items.png/revision/latest?cb=20231004160102\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The three items required.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0e/The_3_items.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/233?cb=20231004160102\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"233\" height=\"133\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"The 3 items.png\" data-image-key=\"The_3_items.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0e/The_3_items.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/233?cb=20231004160102\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:The_3_items.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">The three items required.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<ul><li>The left spot holds the Meteor Core.</li>\n<li>The middle spot holds the Adurite Key.</li>\n<li>The right spot holds the Burning Skull.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Once all items are inserted into their corresponding spots, all of the slots will close, consuming the materials. The center wall will begin to raise, followed by an explosion. The Emberbane will fall onto the ground to be claimed.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Tips\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/bd/Diamond_Subtitle.png/revision/latest?cb=20250605041031\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Diamond Subtitle\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Diamond Subtitle.png\" data-image-key=\"Diamond_Subtitle.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/bd/Diamond_Subtitle.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20250605041031\" /></a></span> Other Tips</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Be sure to carry the supplies in a <a href=\"/wiki/Small_Crate\" title=\"Small Crate\">crate</a> or using <a href=\"/wiki/Grabby_Grabber\" title=\"Grabby Grabber\">one of</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Grabbiest_Grabber\" title=\"Grabbiest Grabber\">the grabbers</a>. This way, all of the materials will be easy to transport up to the top of the plateau, and down into the crafting chamber.</li>\n<li>If this guide was too confusing for you check out some of the following resources!\n<ul><li>This <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E6awKaeVZ4g\">Youtube video</a> for a video guide by <i>FrumpyPlays</i>.</li>\n<li>This <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nWtEXKqyOfs\">YouTube video</a> for a video guide by <i>Theofficialbrick.</i></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/dd/Hexagon_Question.png/revision/latest?cb=20250616224254\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Hexagon Question\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Hexagon Question.png\" data-image-key=\"Hexagon_Question.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/dd/Hexagon_Question.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20250616224254\" /></a></span> Trivia</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-right \" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 63px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/86/Yup.png/revision/latest?cb=20231004160547\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Old inventory icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"63\" height=\"65\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Yup.png\" data-image-key=\"Yup.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/86/Yup.png/revision/latest?cb=20231004160547\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/86/Yup.png/revision/latest?cb=20231004160547\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Old inventory icon\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/86/Yup.png/revision/latest?cb=20231004160547\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"63\" height=\"65\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Yup.png\" data-image-key=\"Yup.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/86/Yup.png/revision/latest?cb=20231004160547\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Old inventory icon</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure> \n<ul><li>The Emberbane is the most difficult axe to obtain as of v1.36.0.</li>\n<li>Prior to v1.51.0, the Emberbane's inventory icon was that of the Tall Refined Axe, albeit with a black handle and red axe head.</li>\n<li>Using 8 Emberbane can make a <a href=\"/wiki/DESTROYER_OF_WORLDS\" title=\"DESTROYER OF WORLDS\">DESTROYER OF WORLDS</a>.</li>\n<li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903142633\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.055 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.076 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 137/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 61/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019401/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   32.406      1 Template:Axe\n100.00%   32.406      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:1614-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903142633 and revision id 20955. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Tools","Axes"],"links":[{"title":"Acidlands","exists":true},{"title":"Adurite","exists":true},{"title":"Adurite Key","exists":true},{"title":"Alan's AutoLogistics","exists":true},{"title":"Ash Tree","exists":true},{"title":"DESTROYER OF WORLDS","exists":true},{"title":"Dugg's Digging","exists":true},{"title":"Ferwater","exists":true},{"title":"Finlay","exists":true},{"title":"Flowering Meadows","exists":true},{"title":"Grabbiest Grabber","exists":true},{"title":"Grabby Grabber","exists":true},{"title":"Hallow Tree","exists":true},{"title":"Junior Scientist","exists":true},{"title":"Lost woods","exists":true},{"title":"Magma Caves","exists":true},{"title":"Magma Tree","exists":true},{"title":"Meteor core","exists":true},{"title":"Mike's Mines","exists":true},{"title":"Pirate Boat","exists":true},{"title":"Refined Axe","exists":true},{"title":"Refined Chisel","exists":true},{"title":"Refined Pickaxe","exists":true},{"title":"Refined Scooba Tank","exists":true},{"title":"Skull","exists":true},{"title":"Skull Rock","exists":true},{"title":"Small Bomb","exists":true},{"title":"Small Crate","exists":true},{"title":"The Oak Depot","exists":true},{"title":"Oke desert","exists":false}],"images":["Emberbane.png","Diamond_Main_Titles.png","Hexagon_Quests.png","Diamond_Subtitle.png","Meteor_Crash.png","Skull_Rock_Location.gif","Emberbane_Wall_Location.gif","The_3_items.png","Hexagon_Question.png","Yup.png"]}
